{"id":"ec28b62254928d73","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-name.md","title":"Name","display":"df-name — Name","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-name","aliases":["58-df-name"],"display":"df-name — Name","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-name"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-name</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-name — Name"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{x}\">\\(\\dot{x}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-名字)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\lambda\">\\(\\alpha,\\lambda\\)</span> (ordinal-stage parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in V\">\\(P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^P_\\alpha\">\\(V^P_\\alpha\\)</span> (rank-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> stage of the forcing-name hierarchy, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> (defined here; forcing-name predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}zero} \\vdash V^P_0\\coloneqq\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}zero} \\vdash V^P_0\\coloneqq\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}successor} \\vdash P\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to V^P_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathcal P(V^P_\\alpha\\times P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}successor} \\vdash P\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to V^P_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathcal P(V^P_\\alpha\\times P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to V^P_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}V^P_\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name\\text{-}limit} \\vdash \\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to V^P_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}V^P_\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name} \\vdash \\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\leftrightarrow P\\in V\\land\\exists\\alpha\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\dot x\\in V^P_\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}name} \\vdash \\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\leftrightarrow P\\in V\\land\\exists\\alpha\\;(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\dot x\\in V^P_\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The class of all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names is customarily denoted <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^P=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}V^P_\\alpha\">\\(V^P=\\bigcup_{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}}V^P_\\alpha\\)</span>; this is a proper class notation, not an ordinary function set.</li>\n<li>The canonical name for the generic filter is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot G=\\{\\langle\\check p,p\\rangle:p\\in P\\}\">\\(\\dot G=\\{\\langle\\check p,p\\rangle:p\\in P\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":